	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnFixed,	L"FIXED"
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnFixedDescription,	L"Rounds the first parameter to the number of decimals determined by the second parameter and returns it as a string. The third parameter specifies whether to omit commas in the output string."
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnLeft,	L"LEFT"
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnLeftDescription,	L"Returns the first character or characters in a text string. The second parameter defines the number of characters to extract. The single-byte version."
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnLeftB,	L"LEFTB"
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnLeftBDescription,	L"Returns the first character or characters in a text string. The second parameter defines the number of characters to extract. The double-byte version."
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnTanh,	L"TANH"
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnTanhDescription,	L"Returns the hyperbolic tangent."
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnTrunc,	L"TRUNC"
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnTruncDescription,	L"Truncates a fractional part of the specified numeric value."
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnASC,	L"ASC"
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnASCDescription,	L"Replaces the full-width (that is, double-byte) English letters or katakana with the corresponding half-width (that is, single-byte) characters."
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnBahtText,	L"BAHTTEXT"
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnBahtTextDescription,	L"Converts a number to text, using the \x201cbaht\x201c currency format."
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnChar,	L"CHAR"
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnCharDescription,	L"Returns the character specified y a number. Use CHAR to translate code page numbers you might get from files on other types of computers into characters."
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnClean,	L"CLEAN"
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnCleanDescription,	L"Removes all non-printable characters from text. Use CLEAN on text imported from other applications that contains characters that may not print with your operating system."
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnCode,	L"CODE"
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnCodeDescription,	L"Returns a numeric code for the first character in a text string. The returned code corresponds to the character set used by your computer."
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnConcatenate,	L"CONCATENATE"
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnConcatenateDescription,	L"Joins several text strings in one text string. An alternative to \x201c&\x201d."
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnSumIF,	L"SUMIF"
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnSumIFDescription,	L"Sums the numeric values within an array that meet a specific criterion."
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnSumIFS,	L"SUMIFS"
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnSumIFSDescription,	L"Sums the numeric values within an array that meet multiple criteria."
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnSumProduct,	L"SUMPRODUCT"
